       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks like it may be an error.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is double the maximum labeled daily dose for adults in a monitored setting (3,200 mg/day). The usual maximum single dose is 800 mg. A dose this high carries a serious risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg by mouth four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg by mouth three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that it is intentional. Otherwise, give me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it."
